m('''## 04. Data & Source Integrity\n\nThe 2010-01 to 2026-09 frozen panel is inherited from a previous manually transcribed G.17 industry study, not downloaded as independent historical releases. The official underlying publisher is A-grade, but inherited transcription is a material additional data-quality risk. Ten recent values have been independently spot-checked against the public FRED pages; **the other 593 have not been independently audited**. Annual benchmark and monthly revisions may change historical rows.''')
