m('''## 05. Point-in-Time Availability\n\n**No PIT proof.** Inputs use month **t−2**, outcome is **t+3**, and training labels are admitted only when their outcome observation month is at most **t−2**. This enforces a conservative mechanical delay and a 5-month gap between the last training formation and each test origin; it **does not** reconstruct original release vintages or solve future revisions.''')
